WEBVTT

00:13:28.790 --> 00:13:31.199
just walking safely in her crop.

00:13:31.867 --> 00:13:35.127
Finally, I want to get to my vision,

00:13:35.151 --> 00:13:37.103
or, in fact, to my dream.

00:13:37.611 --> 00:13:39.634
Because, you see, this is the reality.

00:13:39.658 --> 00:13:41.134
Have a look at the gap.

00:13:41.158 --> 00:13:43.276
If we take the overall turnover

00:13:43.300 --> 00:13:45.745
of the biocontrol industry worldwide,

00:13:45.769 --> 00:13:47.643
it's 250 million dollars.

00:13:48.762 --> 00:13:51.856
And look at the overall pesticide industry

00:13:51.880 --> 00:13:53.734
in all the crops throughout the world.

00:13:54.077 --> 00:13:56.948
I think it's times 100
or something like that.

00:13:56.972 --> 00:13:58.678
Twenty-five billion.

00:13:58.702 --> 00:14:01.317
So there is a huge gap to bridge.